============================================================

  Imagine each H-value as an ENERGY LEVEL.
  Transitions between levels emit 'photons' with rapidity
  = |rapidity(H1) - rapidity(H2)|.

  At n=5, the H-spectrum is {1, 3, 5, 9, 11, 13, 15}.
