============================================================
WHICH H-VALUE RATIOS ARE MUSICAL INTERVALS?
============================================================

  H2/H1 is a musical interval if it's a superparticular ratio (n+1)/n.
  Q^{-1}((n+1)/n) = 1/(2n+1) = a reciprocal odd number.

